WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.600
Begin on hands and knees, then slowly widen the knees out to the sides.

2
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:03.200
Flex the feet and turn the ankles in line with the knees, inner edges down.

3
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:04.800
Lower onto the forearms and keep the hips stacked over the knees.

4
00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:06.400
Ease the hips gently back and down, only as far as feels safe.

5
00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:08.000
Breathe slowly and hold, then walk the knees back in to exit with care.
